---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — e-Learning Practest"
  description="Privacy Policy and data protection practices for e-Learning Practest (a brand of Vinstitution / VPD Vastus Ventures Pvt. Ltd.)."
>
  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="legal-container">
      <span class="badge">Legal & Compliance</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Last updated: July 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-content">
    <div class="legal-container card">
      <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
      <p>
        e-Learning Practest ("we", "our", "us") is a brand of Vinstitution, a segment of VPD Vastus Ventures Private Limited. 
        We are committed to protecting the privacy of our students, users, and visitors. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, 
        use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website <code>practest.live</code> or use our application <code>app.practest.live</code>.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Personal Information:</strong> Full name, email address, phone number, and password credentials provided during registration.</li>
        <li><strong>Verification Data:</strong> Mobile OTP verification status and email verification timestamps.</li>
        <li><strong>Academic Data:</strong> Course enrollments, lesson video watching progress, test session attempts, answers submitted, scores, time per question, and percentiles.</li>
        <li><strong>Payment & Transaction Data:</strong> Offline activation proof uploads or payment transaction references.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To provide, operate, and maintain our online test series engine and LMS features.</li>
        <li>To compute accurate test analytics, rank scores, and subject performance reports.</li>
        <li>To verify student identities and prevent unauthorized access or account sharing.</li>
        <li>To send important course updates, score reports, and account notifications.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Data Sharing & Security</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We store data securely in production 
        databases with strict access controls. Third-party integrations (such as Google OAuth, MSG91 SMS, and Cloudflare CDN) receive 
        only the minimum required tokens/data to perform their respective services.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Cookies & Tracking</h2>
      <p>
        We use essential cookies to maintain user authentication sessions (Sanctum SPA cookies) and store theme preferences. 
        Where consented via our Consent Manager, standard analytical pixels (GA4, GTM, Meta Pixel) track anonymized conversion events.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions or grievances regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact our Grievance Officer at:
      </p>
      <address>
        <strong>VPD Vastus Ventures Private Limited (Vinstitution Segment)</strong><br />
        2nd Floor, Property No. 44, Regal Building, Connaught Place, New Delhi — 110090<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:support@practest.live">support@practest.live</a><br />
        Phone: <a href="tel:+919310959596">+91 93109 59596</a>
      </address>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-hero {
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15), transparent 70%);
  }
  .legal-container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1);
    color: var(--accent);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .subtitle {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .legal-content {
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem 5rem;
  }
  .card {
    background: var(--panel-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    padding: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  h2:first-of-type {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  ul {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  address {
    font-style: normal;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
</style>
